# SwiftUI views

- Colors/fonts: use `Theme.teal`, `Theme.sand`, `Theme.ink`, `Theme.muted`, `Theme.titleFont`, etc. Do not invent `Color(red:...)` or system fonts in views.
- Reuse `NetworkBadge` and `ProviderAvatar` from `Theme.swift`.
- Icon-only controls need `.accessibilityLabel(...)`.
- Prefer `NavigationStack` + `List`/`ScrollView` patterns already used in `BrowseView` and `FavoritesView`.
- Keep booking UI in `BookingSheet`; do not invent a new booking flow elsewhere.
